<title>UK: RHEINHYP sets 300 mln mark four-year bond.</title>
<headline>RHEINHYP sets 300 mln mark four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Bayerische Vereinsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINHYP FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  RHEINHYP RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    14.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.345   PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    99.82     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 118 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
